{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "baseball-game-api-collection",
		"name": "Baseball Game API",
		"description": "實況野球風格賽季制棒球遊戲 API 測試集合\n\n**建議測試順序：**\n1. Reset Database - 重置資料庫（會建立測試用的 Season: 2025-1 和範例統計資料）\n2. Get All Teams - 確認球隊資料\n3. Get Season by ID (2025-1) - 測試賽季查詢\n4. Get Hitting Leaders (2025-1) - 測試統計查詢\n5. Simulate Game - 模擬比賽\n\n**注意事項：**\n- 所有 Season/Statistics API 都需要先執行 Reset Database\n- SeasonId 格式為 'YYYY-N' (例如: 2025-1)\n- PlayerId 請參考資料庫中的實際 ID",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Database",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Reset Database",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/game/reset-db",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"game",
								"reset-db"
							]
						},
						"description": "重置資料庫並載入種子資料（包含球隊、球員、投手）"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "資料庫管理相關 API"
		},
		{
